[
 {
  "nev": "e-hero",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio ds-hatter-vaj\" id=\"kezdes\"><div class=\"ds-burok ds-hero-racs\"><div class=\"ds-hero-szoveg\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">Green lifestyle app from Hungary</div><h1 class=\"ds-cim1\">Don't just claim it. <span class=\"ds-kiemel\">Do it, measure it,</span> show it.</h1><p class=\"ds-lead\">beeco is a green lifestyle app and community. We help companies and cities turn people into a swarm of real, measurable green action, and we hand you the numbers to prove it.</p><div class=\"ds-gombsor\"><a class=\"ds-gomb\" href=\"#contact\">Talk to us</a><a class=\"ds-gomb ds-masod\" href=\"https://www.beeco.hu/letoltes?utm_source=websummit&amp;utm_medium=en&amp;utm_campaign=hero\">Get the app</a><a class=\"ds-gomb ds-masod\" href=\"/\">Magyarul</a></div><div class=\"ds-chipsor\"><div class=\"ds-chip\">ONE Digital Award 2025: 1st place</div><div class=\"ds-chip\">25,000+ downloads</div><div class=\"ds-chip\">4.6 on the App Store</div></div><p class=\"ds-forras\">The app is currently available in Hungarian.</p></div><figure class=\"ds-foto ds-hero-foto\"><img class=\"ds-foto-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/67a8acb53c7158693ab3ee84_Beeco%20csapatke%CC%81p%20%E2%80%93%20nagy.avif\" alt=\"The beeco team in beige t-shirts, with one member in a bee costume\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption class=\"ds-foto-felirat\">The swarm, all hands</figcaption></figure></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-miert",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio ds-hatter-feher\" id=\"why\"><div class=\"ds-burok\"><div class=\"ds-szekcio-fej\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">Why now</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">Green claims need proof now</h2></div><div class=\"ds-ketto\"><div class=\"ds-kartya\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Generic green claims are banned</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Since 27 September 2026, EU law bans unproven generic environmental claims such as “eco-friendly company”, and claims based on offsetting. Companies need concrete, verified action instead.</p><p class=\"ds-forras\"><a class=\"ds-szoveglink\" href=\"https://transition-pathways.europa.eu/legislation/directive-eu-2024825-empowering-consumer-green-transition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Directive (EU) 2024/825 ›</a></p></div><div class=\"ds-kartya\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Reporting got simpler, not optional</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">After Omnibus I, CSRD applies to companies above 1,000 employees and EUR 450 million turnover. Most others report voluntarily with the simpler VSME standard, and they need simple, credible social and community data.</p><p class=\"ds-forras\"><a class=\"ds-szoveglink\" href=\"https://www.aoshearman.com/en/insights/agreement-on-the-csrd-cs3d-omnibus-package-key-changes-and-implications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CSRD Omnibus I summary ›</a></p></div></div></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-piller",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio\"><div class=\"ds-burok\"><div class=\"ds-szekcio-fej\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">How it works</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">Engage. Measure. Show.</h2></div><div class=\"ds-harom\"><div class=\"ds-kartya\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfb0f2f41b180badebb7_fs-piko-raj.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Engage</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Your people take real action, playfully: they water young trees, build nest boxes, complete challenges in the app and collect nectar.</p></div><div class=\"ds-kartya\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcf7d46bae73bbde8f3de_fs-piko-kupa.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Measure</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Every paid package comes with an Impact Report: measured data, sources and method, linked to the SDGs and VSME data points.</p></div><div class=\"ds-kartya\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfb0356d56416f62a171_fs-piko-sziv.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Show</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Campaigns, press and in-app visibility, plus ready-made, verified sentences you can use in your communication.</p></div></div></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-ajanlat",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio ds-hatter-zold\" id=\"offers\"><div class=\"ds-burok\"><div class=\"ds-szekcio-fej\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">For companies &amp; cities</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">Six ways to work with the swarm</h2><p class=\"ds-lead\">Every offer comes in three steps: a low-risk starter, a core subscription and a named partnership.</p></div><div class=\"ds-utak\"><a class=\"ds-ut ds-ut-kiemelt\" href=\"#contact\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfb16b9d194eb04d6ec1_fs-piko-telefon.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">beeco@work</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Your team in the app: internal green challenges, a shared footprint, nectar competitions and a monthly Impact Report.</p><div class=\"ds-tovabb-nyil\">Ask for a demo ›</div></a><a class=\"ds-ut\" href=\"#contact\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcf7cf2f41b180badc6a6_fs-piko-kanna.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Watering Swarm</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Corporate tree-watering days with Hungary&#x27;s first community tree-watering campaign, June to September.</p><div class=\"ds-tovabb-nyil\">Book a day ›</div></a><a class=\"ds-ut\" href=\"#contact\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfae356d56416f62a05f_fs-piko-madarpont.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Bird Swarm</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Build nest boxes and feeders, bird walks with BirdLife Hungary (MME), October to March.</p><div class=\"ds-tovabb-nyil\">Book a day ›</div></a><a class=\"ds-ut\" href=\"#contact\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfb1a57f9d8d1eba51c5_fs-piko-telepules.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">City package</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Tree watering, bird protection, a local green map and resident programmes, with a yearly Impact Report.</p><div class=\"ds-tovabb-nyil\">Talk to us ›</div></a><a class=\"ds-ut\" href=\"#contact\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfb0aac2053c2cb040ee_fs-piko-taska.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Partner program</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Green shops and producers on the map, with coupons that bring conscious customers through the door.</p><div class=\"ds-tovabb-nyil\">Join ›</div></a><a class=\"ds-ut\" href=\"#contact\"><img class=\"ds-kartya-piko\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/6acdcfaf356d56416f62a0d9_fs-piko-otlet.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"ds-cim3\">Green marketing</h3><p class=\"ds-szoveg\">Campaigns, content and video built only on verified claims, and sponsorship of beeco campaigns.</p><div class=\"ds-tovabb-nyil\">Talk to us ›</div></a></div></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-hatas",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio ds-hatter-feher\" id=\"impact\"><div class=\"ds-burok ds-ketto\"><div class=\"ds-hero-szoveg\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">Measured impact</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">Tree watering almost doubled in one year</h2><p class=\"ds-lead\">In summer 2026, residents gave 784,352 litres of water to young trees in 15 municipalities. This is the kind of number every partner gets in its Impact Report.</p></div><div class=\"ds-grafikon\"><div class=\"ds-cim3\">Volunteer Tree Watering, 2025 and 2026</div><div><div class=\"ds-grafikon-felirat\">Water given (litres)</div><div class=\"ds-sav-sor\"><div class=\"ds-sav-ev\">2025</div><div class=\"ds-sav ds-sav-elozo ds-sav-51\">400,000</div></div><div class=\"ds-sav-sor\"><div class=\"ds-sav-ev\">2026</div><div class=\"ds-sav ds-sav-100\">784,352</div></div></div><div><div class=\"ds-grafikon-felirat\">Active volunteers</div><div class=\"ds-sav-sor\"><div class=\"ds-sav-ev\">2025</div><div class=\"ds-sav ds-sav-elozo ds-sav-69\">1,500</div></div><div class=\"ds-sav-sor\"><div class=\"ds-sav-ev\">2026</div><div class=\"ds-sav ds-sav-100\">2,162</div></div></div><p class=\"ds-forras\">Sources: Telex, 21 September 2025 (2025); beeco campaign close, October 2026 (2026). Bars are to scale within each row.</p></div></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-szam",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio ds-hatter-sotet\"><div class=\"ds-burok\"><div class=\"ds-szekcio-fej\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">Traction</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">A national community in three years</h2></div><div class=\"ds-szamsav\"><div class=\"ds-szam\"><div class=\"ds-szam-ertek\">25,000+</div><div class=\"ds-szam-felirat\">downloads</div></div><div class=\"ds-szam\"><div class=\"ds-szam-ertek\">23,000+</div><div class=\"ds-szam-felirat\">green spots on the map</div></div><div class=\"ds-szam\"><div class=\"ds-szam-ertek\">15</div><div class=\"ds-szam-felirat\">partner municipalities</div></div><div class=\"ds-szam\"><div class=\"ds-szam-ertek\">2,162</div><div class=\"ds-szam-felirat\">active tree-watering volunteers in 2026</div></div><div class=\"ds-szam\"><div class=\"ds-szam-ertek\">100+</div><div class=\"ds-szam-felirat\">green events every month</div></div><div class=\"ds-szam\"><div class=\"ds-szam-ertek\">12</div><div class=\"ds-szam-felirat\">professional partners</div></div></div><p class=\"ds-forras ds-forras-sotet\">Sources: App Store and Google Play listings, beeco internal data, October 2026.</p></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-tortenet",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio\"><div class=\"ds-burok ds-ketto\"><div class=\"ds-hero-szoveg\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">Our story</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">Award-winning, volunteer-powered</h2><p class=\"ds-lead\">An award-winning Hungarian startup built by 29 volunteers and professionals in 7 squads, with university and civic partners. Next goal: beeco beyond borders.</p></div><ul class=\"ds-ido-lista\"><li class=\"ds-ido-elem\"><span class=\"ds-ido-ho\">2026</span><span>Volunteer Tree Watering: 784,352 litres, 2,162 volunteers, 15 municipalities. CsicsergŐsz bird campaign. Back at Web Summit.</span></li><li class=\"ds-ido-elem\"><span class=\"ds-ido-ho\">2025</span><span>ONE Digital Award, 1st place (green category). F6S: 2nd most outstanding sustainability startup in Hungary. First community tree-watering campaign.</span></li><li class=\"ds-ido-elem\"><span class=\"ds-ido-ho\">2024</span><span>App and Hungary&#x27;s largest green map launched. Web Summit, Lisbon. NTK and Design Terminal Start: top 20 of 250 teams.</span></li><li class=\"ds-ido-elem\"><span class=\"ds-ido-ho\">2023</span><span>beeco is born. EIT Climate Launchpad international final. MVM Edison startup competition, 3rd place.</span></li></ul></div></section>",
  "css": ""
 },
 {
  "nev": "e-sajto",
  "html": "<section class=\"ds-szekcio ds-hatter-feher\"><div class=\"ds-burok\"><div class=\"ds-szekcio-fej\"><div class=\"ds-szalag\">Featured in</div><h2 class=\"ds-cim2\">Press and professional partners</h2></div><div class=\"ds-logosor\"><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/68f55aee199eab3916f73898_Ke%CC%81pernyo%CC%8Bfoto%CC%81%202025-10-19%20-%2023.40.47.avif\" alt=\"Telex\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/67f557683eb72914272e7e6e_Trade-magazin-logo-5x-200x150-1.avif\" alt=\"Trade magazin\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/65881acdffa52b464011a162_marie.avif\" alt=\"Marie Claire\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/658c039adc0116824144eeb6_asdas.avif\" alt=\"Startuponline\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/65f36d002f7378554da79672_leto%CC%88lte%CC%81s.avif\" alt=\"We Love Budapest\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/65f36d726c43f4c22c70061b_Ke%CC%81pernyo%CC%8Bfoto%CC%81%202024-03-14%20-%2022.34.36.avif\" alt=\"Daily News Hungary\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"ds-logosor ds-logosor-sajto\"><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/655be59dbcf37965dbacd978_BME.avif\" alt=\"BME\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9a