ading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/68c9565364d3fbc241f94de6_Ke%CC%81pernyo%CC%8Bfoto%CC%81%202025-09-16%20-%2014.20.50.avif\" alt=\"MAVEG Magyar Vegán Egyesület\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"ds-logo\"><img class=\"ds-logo-kep\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/webflow-prod-assets/648ebb1f9ae84f3d530e2f2d/68c956aaf03442140eafed02_i-Dest_logo_color_short_pos%20(1).avif\" alt=\"I-DEST\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></div></section>",
